messages:
maria (AE): Quick heads-up: BigBank POC asks for streaming responses + live function/tool calls + guaranteed structured JSON output validation. Also have a security questionnaire and pricing concerns for long-running streams. Need SE/eng input on integration and blockers.

devon (SE): Summary from presales: streaming SDK returns partial events and function_call events. Main risks: schema enforcement on the client, mid-stream triggers that must be executed exactly-once, and connection-drop recovery.

james (Eng): Implementation note: we can emit a deterministic call_id in the function_call event so downstream services can dedupe. For strict JSON output, our structured-output mode emits the final JSON as a distinct completed event.

maria (AE): They want the function to run as soon as model emits it (fraud enrichment). Concerned about duplicate execution if reconnects happen.

devon (SE): Recommend idempotency at the enrichment service. We'll include call_id in the stream to enable at-least-once -> de-dup semantics. Example streaming fragment we can demo:
```
{
  "type": "function_call",
  "name": "enrich_account",
  "call_id": "uuid-1234-abc",
  "args": {"acct": "98765"}
}
```
We can add the call_id field to streaming payloads for the POC.

maria (AE): Is adding call_id a breaking change? Customer asked if it's guaranteed for every function_call.

james (Eng): Not breaking. We'll gate it behind a feature flag for the POC and ship a small SDK bump. I'll add tests to ensure call_id is present for function_call events.

presales-bot: Security questionnaire posted: https://redwood.internal/q/BB-SEC (partial answers).

sachin (SRE): Security constraints: BigBank requires control plane in VPC-only mode, KMS-backed key wrapping, IP allowlist, and 365d audit log retention. Hosted public API won't satisfy this. Options: Dedicated (reserved capacity in their cloud) or Private (on-prem/VPC). Private takes longer to provision.

ellen (Prod): Pricing FYI: sustained streaming (200 concurrent sessions, ~1.2k tokens/min per stream) is much cheaper on Dedicated reserved capacity versus hosted per-token billing. I can run a cost model if you provide expected DS volumes.

maria (AE): For the POC can we show: streaming -> function_call (with call_id) -> immediate execution -> final structured JSON validated against schema? That should satisfy BigBank's security and audit asks for the demo flow.

devon (SE): Workplan: 1) create demo SDK repo (JS + Python) showing streaming handling with call_id and a function handler that records call_id+result to an audit log. 2) enable structured-output mode and run schema validation on final event. 3) deploy demo on Dedicated sandbox with KMS + IP allowlist. 4) SRE to fill questionnaire gaps.

james (Eng): I'll implement streaming SDK change and a JS sample:
```js
const stream = client.responses.stream({ model: 'rwd-stream-1', input: prompt, feature_flags: {call_id: true} });
for await (const ev of stream) {
  if (ev.type === 'function_call') {
    // ev.call_id available - ensure idempotent handling
    await enrichmentService.invoke({ call_id: ev.call_id, name: ev.name, args: ev.args });
  }
  if (ev.type === 'structured_output' && ev.complete) {
    schemaValidator.validate(ev.json);
  }
}
```
I'll open the PR today and a test harness that simulates reconnects.

maria (AE): They also ask if we can run a short-lived Private agent for the POC (data residency).

sachin (SRE): Private is doable but needs infra lead + ~2 weeks for provisioning and security sign-off. Dedicated in their VPC is faster (~5 business days) and hits most of their controls. For the POC timeline, Dedicated recommended.

ellen (Prod): I'll prepare two cost/eta paths: Dedicated-fasttrack vs Private-longer. Sending checklist DM.

maria (AE): Timeline: customer needs a working demo in 10 business days. Who owns which pieces?

devon (SE): I'll own the demo repo and assemble the sample flows. james owns SDK change and PR. sachin will scope infra and confirm Dedicated sandbox ETA. ellen will produce the cost estimate. maria will coordinate questionnaire responses and schedule the customer demo. I'll book a sync with BigBank for Thu 10:30.

james (Eng): Confirmed. PR + demo branch by EOD +3.

maria (AE): Thanks team 44d I'll update the customer and attach the questionnaire.
